PN,36901
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,FScientists have found a new window of
OL,7,Fopportunity to attack aggressive brain
OL,8,Fcancer with chemotherapy.
OL,10,FInstead of waiting a few weeks after
OL,11,Fsurgery to start treatment, early
OL,12,Fresearch from the University of
OL,13,FManchester suggests that chemotherapy
OL,14,Fcould be most impactful in the minutes
OL,15,Fand days after an operation to remove
OL,16,Fa glioblastoma.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,FThe study found that the barrier to
OL,7,Fthe brain is disrupted in the early
OL,8,Fperiods after surgery, therefore
OL,9,Fallowing higher concentrations of the
OL,10,Fdrugs to reach the affected area.
OL,12,FExperts said that while the findings
OL,13,Fare still in their early stages, they
OL,14,Fcould potentially reshape care for
OL,15,Fglioblastoma patients.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,FThey said that the delay of four to
OL,7,Fsix weeks between surgery and the
OL,8,Fstart of chemotherapy and radiotherapy
OL,9,Fhas "largely been regarded as a
OL,10,Fnecessity to ensure complete recovery
OL,11,Ffrom surgery".
OL,13,FBut the researchers said that in the
OL,14,Ffuture, the findings could help medics
OL,15,F"exploit" these windows of opportunity
OL,16,Fto attack the cancerous cells left
OL,17,Fbehind after surgery.
OL,26,@qD@EOUsD@MO]wD@AOUwD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,FGlioblastoma is one of the most
OL,7,Faggressive types of brain cancer with
OL,8,Fthe average survival time between 12
OL,9,Fto 18 months. About 25% of patients
OL,10,Fsurvive past one year, and only 5%
OL,11,Fsurvive for five years or more.
OL,13,FIt comes after Scottish swimmer Archie
OL,14,FGoodburn made an emotional plea to
OL,15,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham to
OL,16,Festablish a national brain cancer lead.
OL,18,FThe 25-year-old was diagnosed with a
OL,19,Fdifferent type of brain tumour, he has
OL,20,Fthree large oligodendrogliomas, and is
OL,21,Fnot expected to live into his 40's.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,FHe described how trials around the
OL,7,Fworld are not being seen in the UK
OL,8,Fwhich is "unfair and unjust".
OL,10,FSpeaking on BBC Breakfast, Goodburn
OL,11,Fwas in tears as he said: "Please
OL,12,Finvest and make the difference. I'm on
OL,13,Fmy knees begging for not just my own
OL,14,Flife but those who are affected and
OL,15,Fthe families all around the country.
OL,17,F"This has to change, it has been going
OL,18,Fon for too long and the suffering is
OL,19,Funbearable."
OL,26,@pD@JOUpD@\O]sD@ZOUyD@AOU{D@LO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister responded to the
OL,7,Femotional plea by inviting Goodburn to
OL,8,Fmeet him.
OL,10,FThe authors of the new study,
OL,11,Fpublished in the journal Science
OL,12,FTranslational Medicine, said that the
OL,13,Feffects of tumour removal on the blood-
OL,14,Fbrain barrier, and the impacts of
OL,15,Fchemotherapy, "have not been
OL,16,Fsystematically studied" in the past.
OL,26,@wD@OOUxD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,FResearcher's from The University of
OL,7,FManchester performed mice studies to
OL,8,Fmimic the procedure and used a
OL,9,Fformulation which does not typically
OL,10,Fenter the brain unless there is
OL,11,Fdisruption to the blood-brain barrier.
OL,13,FThe team found that the surgery
OL,14,Fdisrupts the blood brain barrier
OL,15,F"revealing the opportunity for early
OL,16,Ftreatment unitisiation within specific
OL,17,Ftemporal windows".
OL,19,FThere windows are 15 minutes and 48 to
OL,20,F72 hours post surgery.
OL,26,@wD@AOUyD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,FThey said that by "exploiting" these
OL,7,Ftime frames, they "effectively
OL,8,Fsuppressed tumour recurrence".
OL,10,FDr Thomas Kisby, co-lead on the study
OL,11,Fat The University of Manchester.
OL,13,FDr Kisby added: "For the first time,
OL,14,Fwe've shown that glioblastoma surgery
OL,15,Fbriefly exposes a vulnerability we can
OL,16,Fexploit.
OL,18,F"If treatment is timed during specific
OL,19,Fwindows we identified, it is able to
OL,20,Fhalt the disease significantly before
OL,21,Fit regrows.
OL,26,@nD@SOUnD@^O]oD@SOUpD@]O]uD@QOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,F"We suggest that the hours and days
OL,7,Fimmediately after surgery may hold the
OL,8,Fkey to stopping glioblastoma from
OL,9,Freturning.
OL,11,F"It also raises the possibility that
OL,12,Fother established medicines could be
OL,13,Fredeployed in smarter, more strategic
OL,14,Fways."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,FCo-lead of the study, Professor Kostas
OL,7,FKostarelos, from The University of
OL,8,FManchester and the Catalan Institute
OL,9,Fof Nanoscience and Nanotechnology in
OL,10,FBarcelona, added: "This research has
OL,11,Fthe potential to open a new frontier
OL,12,Fin post-operative cancer care.
OL,26,@rD@SOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,F"After surgery, brain tumours often
OL,7,Fgrow back from the tissue surrounding
OL,8,Fthe area where the tumour was removed.
OL,9,FWe propose using the latest targeted
OL,10,Ftreatments, including nanoparticle-
OL,11,Fbased medicines, immunotherapy, and
OL,12,Fgene therapies, to treat this high-
OL,13,Frisk area and improve patients'
OL,14,Fchances of long-term survival."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,FDr Gerben Borst, honorary consultant
OL,7,Foncologist at The Christie NHS
OL,8,FFoundation Trust, said: "One of the
OL,9,Fgreatest challenges in treating
OL,10,Fglioblastoma is eliminating the
OL,11,Fmicroscopic cancer cells that remain
OL,12,Fafter surgery.
OL,14,F"These findings suggest that a better
OL,15,Funderstanding of the body's natural
OL,16,Fresponse to surgery could help us
OL,17,Fdeliver anti-cancer drugs more
OL,18,Feffectively, rather than relying
OL,19,Fsolely on the development of entirely
OL,20,Fnew and costly medicines.
OL,26,@pD@YOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36913
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786121303
OL,3,CScientists discover new window of
OL,4,Copportunity to treat brain cancer
OL,6,F"While this research is still at an
OL,7,Fearly stage, it provides important
OL,8,Finsights into how drug delivery to the
OL,9,Fbrain could be improved."
OL,11,FProfessor Robert Bristow, director of
OL,12,Fthe Manchester Cancer Research Centre,
OL,13,Fadded: "Glioblastoma is the deadliest
OL,14,Fform of brain cancer, so these
OL,15,Fresearch results are incredibly
OL,16,Fexciting and promises a potential
OL,17,Fbreakthrough in the work to stop the
OL,18,Ftumour cells growing back after
OL,19,Fsurgery."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@HOU{D@IO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/13
